'''Nuknog''' was a [[Reptile|reptilian]] [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] that was [[Homeworld|native]] to the [[planet]] [[Sump]]. They had bulbous heads and small [[brain]]s. They also had short tempers and their diminished brain capacity meant they were not often very successful in society. [[Ark Roose]], a [[Podracer (profession)|podracer]] who participated in the [[Boonta Eve Classic]] race on the [[desert]] [[planet]] [[Tatooine]] during [[32 BBY]] was a Nuknog.<ref name="Alien Archive" />

